      "cooked": "<p><font color=\"green\"><span class=\"bbcode-i\">&lt;Split off of <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/setbacks-wrong-time-and-place-5224\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Setback’s “Wrong Time and Place”</a>&gt;</span></font></p>\n<p>FLAME BARRIER. If a Minion attacks each player and Ra's is the 2nd player, he has Flame Barrier and +1 Fire Damage, which would destroy Minion. Does it destroy the minion BEFORE he deals his damage to any hero's after Ra, or is hero damage dealt, then, minion is destroyed? Ra's Barrier was in play before Minion came into play.</p>",
